    {
      "bbox": [
        519,
        366,
        1305,
        422
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York recognizing the need to improve the quality and delivery of youth services to assist youth development and to prevent and reduce juvenile delinquency; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2588,
          "min": -1.2504
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0071,
          "min": -0.185
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6959,
        "area_px": 44802,
        "density": 0.15533,
        "chars": 184,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.44
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        520,
        422,
        1303,
        478
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, the City is required to conform to the statutes and administrative rules of the State of New York in order to receive and utilize the maximum allocation of funds available for youth services; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2365,
          "min": -1.3229
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0128
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7948,
        "area_px": 45414,
        "density": 0.17501,
        "chars": 204,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        520,
        478,
        1303,
        534
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, steps are currently being taken by The City of New York to effect a decentralization of youth services by redistributing the functions of the Youth Services Agency and thereby improving the delivery of such services; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.196,
          "min": -1.1297
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0233,
          "min": -0.7639
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9524,
        "area_px": 44631,
        "density": 0.21339,
        "chars": 229,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 24.04
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        520,
        534,
        1303,
        571
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, it is necessary and desirable to amend Executive Order No. 36, dated August 28, 1975, so as to decentralize youth services.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1967,
          "min": -1.0378
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
