    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        569,
        753,
        1295,
        884
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"\u00a7 6. To implement policies approved by the Mayor and to develop better coordination of service delivery, a Youth Operations Panel is hereby established consisting of the heads of the following agencies: Department of Recreation, Criminal Justice Coordinating Council, Special Services for Children, Police Department, Department of Employment, Office of Neighborhood Services, Board of Education, Department of Health, Department of Probation, the Administrative Judge of the Family Court and the Office of Management and Budget.\"",
      "logprob_stats": {
